{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40080","label":"MEMORIES TELLER · Part 2"},"label":"MEMORIES TELLER","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce006_3_03_e","next":"event_ce006_2_prologue","speakers":{"com":"Com","privaty":"Privaty","art":"Art"},"icons":{"com":"si_c931_00_s","privaty":"si_c170_00_s","art":"si_c301_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_1","text":"A few days after Hermin's death, the Pioneer Squad arrived and handed over Com to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park","bgArt":"park","image":null,"bgm":"collab_bgm_sb_camp_01","movie":null,"shown":["com"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_2","text":"Com no longer had any trace of its former violent demeanor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_3","text":"It apologized profusely for attacking Privaty and Roam, and for its prior rudeness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_4","text":"It also requested for all of its data to be backed up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_5","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_5","text":"We honored the request, and made two copies: one for the Central Government's data center, and another for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_6","text":"Central Government officials were reluctant to make this data public.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_7","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_7","text":"Probably because, like Hermin, they feared the ugly truths that it contained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_8","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_8","text":"As for what Com thought of all this...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_9","text":"It is fine if it is not made public. I would simply like for everyone who has witnessed this to remember.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_10","text":"Remember that we were there, and how we lived in that place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_11","text":"That is all we need for them to live on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_12","text":"For days, Com remained in front of Hermin's memorial, not moving an inch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_13","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_13","text":"It kept repeating the same words over and over, \"If only I had waited a little longer. If only I hadn't given up.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_14","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_14","text":"A few days later...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["privaty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_15","text":"Commander, let's go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_overjoy","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_16","text":"Go where?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_17","text":"Did you not receive","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_18","text":"the invitation from Enikk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_19","text":"Enikk sent an invitation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_20","text":"Yes. Here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_21","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_21","text":"On Privaty's phone, there is an e-ticket which reads: Couple's ticket to the solo exhibition \"Memories Teller\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_22","text":"Enikk said you and I could go together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_23","text":"Ah, I see. Since this is a couple's ticket, two people can enter using it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_epilogue_24","text":"Yep, that's h...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_epilogue